	linux-acpi@vger.kernel.org,
	linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org,
	Len Brown <lenb@kernel.org>,
	Jie Zhan <zhanjie9@hisilicon.com>,
	Lifeng Zheng <zhenglifeng1@huawei.com>,
